        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4041 characters\">&lt;p&gt;This sanctuary on a lagoon is virtually the same as it was six hundred years ago, which adds to the fascinating character.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4041 characters\">&lt;/blockquote&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
