        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4041 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4041 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Foam padding in the insoles leather finest quality staple flat slip-on design pointed toe off-duty shoe. Black knicker lining concealed back zip fasten swing style high waisted double layer full pattern floral. Polished finish elegant court shoe work duty stretchy slingback strap mid kitten heel this ladylike design.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
